// STRATEGY_REFLECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P797806052" "Training. Tactics. I remember. These will help us."
// STRATEGY_REFLECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1349309937" "Whatever we are, we have a job to do."
// STRATEGY_REFLECTION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1450195650" "Don't feel guilt. We were never human. Never alive."

// STRATEGY_REFLECTION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3983766986" "Memories are illusions. We're of Rularuu now."
// STRATEGY_REFLECTION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1940164597" "We'll make a reflection from you! One of us!"
// STRATEGY_REFLECTION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P221650998" "Yes, it's all clear now. You must die."

// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2598284681" "What am I? Am I alive?"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2226201193" "Why do I look like me?"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3111318382" "The memories keep fading. What am I?"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1953619261" "Do I exist? Am I really who I look like?"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1766736885" "Is that what I am? A shadow, a reflection?"

// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P364853999" "The compulsion! Must...kill! Rularuu!"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3561972631" "I can't stop it. Why do I want to stop it? Rularuu!"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3695317158" "Get away before I, before I... Rularuu. RULARUU! Kill!"
// LOITER_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3707678417" "I'm just a shadow. Life and death don't matter."

// PATROLCHANTRY_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1340475118" "The Kindness. Must hold back the Kind One."
// PATROLCHANTRY_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2709299951" "Find and kill all that is not Rularuu."
// PATROLCHANTRY_REFLECTIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4008715726" "None may reach the Kind One."

// PATROLCHANTRY_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2680032870" "All that matters is Rularuu."
// PATROLCHANTRY_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2350698249" "Kill! Exhult and kill for Rularuu!"
// PATROLCHANTRY_REFLECTIONS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2194065512" "Only Rularuu is truth! Only Rularuu is real!"

// RUMBLE_SHARD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1583289686" "Are you real? Is this real?"
// RUMBLE_SHARD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2162276078" "Rularuu..."
// RUMBLE_SHARD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3862900857" "Must fight. Have to fight."

// RUMBLE_SHARD_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P294703787" "If we don't exist, then death is meaningless!"
// RUMBLE_SHARD_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3093245507" "Rularuu. That's all we are. Parts of the Rularuu."
// RUMBLE_SHARD_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1554585383" "Kill you."

